hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"766","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sadqa-e-Fitr farz kya, khajoor ka saa ya jau ka saa, ghulaam aur aazaad aur mard aur aurat aur chhotey aur badey Musalmaanon par. Aur hukm diya ke wo logon key namaz key liye nikalney se pehley ada kya jaey. (Bukhari: 1503)"
"767","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein Eid-ul-Fitr key din khaaney ka saa nikaaltey they. Aur hamaara khaana jau aur munakka aur paneer aur khajoor tha. (Bukhari: 1510)"
"768","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sadqa-e-Fitr farz kya, jau ka saa ya khajoor ka saa, chhotey aur badey aur aazaad aur ghulaam par. (Bukhari: 1512). Kitaab-ul-Hajj."
